Ethereum Aave V4 Fork Withdraw

GIVEN the Ethereum child Aave v4 adapter
  WHEN a caller other than the vault withdraws
    THEN it reverts
  WHEN the vault withdraws a specific amount
    THEN USDC returns from live Aave v4 and TVL decreases
  WHEN the vault withdraws the max amount
    THEN all supplied USDC returns from live Aave v4
